### Global CSS

To customize the Badge component classes, you can use the `@layer components` directive.
[Learn more](https://tailwindcss.com/docs/adding-custom-styles#adding-component-classes).

```css
@layer components {
  .badge {
    @apply rounded-full text-xs;
  }

  .badge__label {
    @apply font-semibold;
  }

  .badge--accent {
    @apply shadow-sm;
  }
}
```

